Z||000014||Fierokid87||08-30-2001||03:19 PM||||Hey James do what I did.  take all the brackets and such and paint the aluminum parts with aluminum engine paint, and the black brackets paint those with black engine paint, you choice of flat, semi-gloss,-gloss.<BR>Use Chrysler Industrial Red for the plenum and valve covers, etc.  <P>Scott<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLOODY"> Fierokid's  Web site<BR>http://www.angelfire.com/sports/sfiero<P>AIM: Fieroguy1987<BR>ICQ: Fierokid</FONT><P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sfiero.JPG"> ||||reg||1
